WEBVTT

01:30.230 --> 01:34.800
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.120 --> 01:37.900
[Episode 17]

01:38.590 --> 01:41.039
But you must tell me everything

01:41.039 --> 01:43.039
that happened here in detail—

01:43.039 --> 01:43.479
Tell us.

01:43.479 --> 01:43.920
D...

01:45.170 --> 01:47.150
Don't hide anything.

01:49.509 --> 01:51.310
I don't dare hide anything.

01:56.789 --> 01:57.320
Let's go.

02:02.420 --> 02:03.220
They said

02:03.250 --> 02:04.680
if I brought you here,

02:04.710 --> 02:06.770
they would play shuttlecock with me.

02:06.990 --> 02:07.830
I...

02:08.330 --> 02:11.060
just wanted someone
to play shuttlecock with me.

02:11.140 --> 02:12.960
You really like playing shuttlecock
this much?

02:12.960 --> 02:13.430
Yes.

02:28.030 --> 02:29.500
To be honest with you,

02:29.700 --> 02:30.810
before now,

02:30.910 --> 02:34.300
we've never actually seen
the Taotie with our own eyes.

02:34.470 --> 02:36.680
It's just that after people
went into the mountains,

02:36.680 --> 02:38.370
they never came back out.

02:38.400 --> 02:40.310
And when we found the bodies,

02:40.310 --> 02:42.630
they were all missing arms or legs.

02:42.630 --> 02:43.480
So,

02:43.710 --> 02:46.360
we just said it was the Taotie's doing.

02:47.120 --> 02:49.030
You know, it's strange.

02:49.030 --> 02:50.079
In recent years,

02:50.100 --> 02:52.190
the Taotie has been appearing frequently

02:52.190 --> 02:54.050
and often comes into the village.

02:54.260 --> 02:55.470
Then how do you determine

02:55.470 --> 02:57.130
that it's the Taotie who's hurting people?

02:57.130 --> 02:58.800
Everyone knows there's a Taotie

02:58.800 --> 03:00.080
on Mount Qiansui.

03:00.190 --> 03:01.540
Besides the Taotie,

03:01.800 --> 03:03.030
what else could it be?

03:55.780 --> 03:57.340
The Taotie has returned!

03:57.560 --> 03:58.680
Zixiu, you go home.

03:58.680 --> 03:59.579
Go, go, go.

03:59.610 --> 04:00.710
Go, go, go.

04:01.710 --> 04:02.190
Hurry!

04:06.360 --> 04:07.430
Catch the demon!

04:07.710 --> 04:08.560
Catch the demon!

04:08.560 --> 04:09.140
After it!

04:09.310 --> 04:09.910
Where is it?

04:09.910 --> 04:10.570
Over there!

04:12.520 --> 04:13.520
Don't let it escape!

04:13.520 --> 04:14.580
-Here!
-It's here!

04:14.630 --> 04:15.560
Catch the demon!

04:16.000 --> 04:17.160
Chase it!

04:17.800 --> 04:18.459
Over there!

04:18.510 --> 04:19.560
Don't let it get away!

04:19.560 --> 04:20.120
Hurry up!

04:20.120 --> 04:20.950
Where's the demon?

04:20.950 --> 04:21.510
Quick!

04:22.560 --> 04:23.490
Catch the demon!

04:27.920 --> 04:28.830
It's here!

04:34.870 --> 04:35.680
Catch the demon!

04:35.680 --> 04:37.310
Demon, you can't escape!

04:49.360 --> 04:50.110
Stop!

04:56.870 --> 04:57.680
I'm going to kill it

04:57.680 --> 04:58.600
to avenge Ya.

04:58.830 --> 05:00.360
Before we clarify everything,

05:00.360 --> 05:01.360
don't harm the innocent.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.490
Who else could it be?

05:02.870 --> 05:04.190
We already captured it.

05:04.190 --> 05:05.120
Why not kill it?

05:05.630 --> 05:06.920
It has taken human lives,

05:06.920 --> 05:07.950
yet you protect it.

05:07.950 --> 05:09.070
What are your intentions?

05:09.070 --> 05:10.400
We agreed on it already.

05:10.630 --> 05:12.270
We have no more silver
to give to the officials.

05:12.270 --> 05:12.930
Move aside!

05:12.990 --> 05:14.160
Since it's already subdued,

05:14.160 --> 05:15.680
why not get to the bottom of this first?

05:15.680 --> 05:17.390
Kill it! Kill it!

05:17.390 --> 05:18.160
It's a demon!

05:18.600 --> 05:19.330
Kill it!

05:19.830 --> 05:20.510
Kill it!

05:20.800 --> 05:22.860
Kill it! Kill it!

05:22.880 --> 05:24.920
Kill it! Kill it!

05:24.920 --> 05:25.750
Get out of the way!

05:25.750 --> 05:27.160
Yes, kill it!

05:27.600 --> 05:28.390
Kill it.

05:28.510 --> 05:30.190
Kill it!

05:30.210 --> 05:31.390
Kill it.

05:31.390 --> 05:33.120
Kill it!

05:33.140 --> 05:33.920
Kill it!

05:34.000 --> 05:34.800
Silence!

05:37.870 --> 05:39.190
Lock it up first.

05:40.480 --> 05:42.680
We'll decide after the investigation.

05:46.040 --> 05:46.720
Leader,

05:48.360 --> 05:49.430
what do you think?

05:52.040 --> 05:53.000
We will

05:53.830 --> 05:55.560
follow your orders, My Lord.

06:05.800 --> 06:06.510
I know

06:06.830 --> 06:08.490
you don't want to hurt anyone.

06:09.750 --> 06:11.190
If you really wanted to fight,

06:11.190 --> 06:12.790
neither we nor the villagers

06:13.120 --> 06:14.270
could stop you.

06:18.750 --> 06:19.750
Don't be afraid.

06:20.600 --> 06:22.190
I need to remove

06:22.390 --> 06:23.160
this arrow

06:23.160 --> 06:24.920
and apply medicine, okay?

06:32.000 --> 06:33.659
That way, your wound can heal.

06:34.190 --> 06:35.270
It might hurt a bit.

06:35.270 --> 06:36.190
Try to bear it.

06:41.560 --> 06:42.360
What's wrong?

06:42.430 --> 06:43.360
It's nothing.

06:43.750 --> 06:44.360
Get out.

06:48.830 --> 06:49.750
Get out!

06:56.510 --> 06:57.270
It's fine.

07:02.800 --> 07:05.190
I need to remove your outer robe now

07:05.190 --> 07:06.450
to apply the medicine.

07:08.920 --> 07:09.560
Okay, okay.

07:09.560 --> 07:10.560
I won't remove it.

07:11.160 --> 07:12.750
I'll just apply it like this.

07:12.750 --> 07:14.010
This is healing salve.

07:18.280 --> 07:20.680
Why does it look somewhat familiar

07:20.680 --> 07:22.020
yet different?

07:23.950 --> 07:25.000
That's Little Leaf,

07:25.000 --> 07:26.000
a spirit herb.

07:26.830 --> 07:27.830
Don't talk nonsense.

07:27.830 --> 07:28.920
I'm no spirit herb.

07:29.390 --> 07:31.590
I'm a super powerful great demon!

07:37.830 --> 07:39.490
You understand human speech.

07:42.159 --> 07:42.960
Let me ask you,

07:43.750 --> 07:46.409
are you responsible
for the villagers' deaths?

07:50.220 --> 07:52.280
Then let me ask you in a different way.

07:52.460 --> 07:55.060
You've been coming
to the village repeatedly.

07:55.190 --> 07:56.920
Are you looking for something?

08:18.510 --> 08:19.070
Li.

08:22.480 --> 08:24.610
I'd like to borrow something from you.

08:24.720 --> 08:25.650
What do you want?

08:29.560 --> 08:30.040
Here,

08:30.360 --> 08:31.420
take a look at this.

08:32.470 --> 08:33.600
Do you recognize it?

08:33.600 --> 08:35.840
Li says this belonged to his wife.

08:38.549 --> 08:39.280
It's the one!

08:39.480 --> 08:40.150
That's it!

08:43.000 --> 08:44.880
Look at those eyes!

08:45.150 --> 08:46.270
I've seen those eyes before.

08:46.270 --> 08:48.730
They're exactly
like the ones in the forest.

08:53.860 --> 08:54.790
Coming!

08:55.000 --> 08:55.730
Keep it down.

08:56.190 --> 08:58.650
This Taotie
hasn't hurt anyone in my family,

08:58.870 --> 09:00.620
nor damaged my house or fields.

09:00.830 --> 09:02.830
Why are you causing trouble with Li?

09:14.270 --> 09:14.910
Help!

09:15.000 --> 09:15.670
Help me!

09:17.750 --> 09:19.270
Leader, help us!

09:35.930 --> 09:37.990
The dead has really come back to life?

09:54.720 --> 09:56.810
Fire! Hurry to put it out!

09:56.840 --> 09:57.390
Go quickly!

09:57.390 --> 09:58.490
Li, come on!

09:59.720 --> 10:00.120
Hurry!

10:00.200 --> 10:00.730
This way!

10:00.960 --> 10:02.220
There's a fire! Quick!

10:03.150 --> 10:04.390
Has another demon entered the village?

10:04.390 --> 10:05.920
It has nothing to do with me.

10:06.440 --> 10:07.240
Give me your blade.

10:07.240 --> 10:07.690
No way.

10:07.980 --> 10:09.480
What if the Taotie escapes?

10:09.480 --> 10:10.480
I'll stay here and watch.

10:10.480 --> 10:11.600
It's still chained up.

10:11.600 --> 10:12.870
Don't worry, it can't escape.

10:12.870 --> 10:14.320
Help! Help!

10:14.320 --> 10:15.550
Help me!

10:15.790 --> 10:16.600
Help!

10:16.720 --> 10:17.980
Take care of yourself.

10:19.910 --> 10:20.960
Help me!

10:22.200 --> 10:23.840
I don't want to die!

10:24.240 --> 10:25.030
Help!

10:25.030 --> 10:26.480
As if I need you to tell me that.

10:26.480 --> 10:28.610
Taking care of people is what I do best.

10:31.270 --> 10:32.430
Help me!

10:35.790 --> 10:36.440
Get up.

10:37.670 --> 10:38.840
Help me!

10:40.720 --> 10:42.200
Help me!

10:43.080 --> 10:44.920
Help me!

10:45.670 --> 10:47.490
Help! Help me!

10:50.950 --> 10:52.360
Help me!

10:55.620 --> 10:59.520
Save me! Help me quickly!

11:03.320 --> 11:05.910
Save me quickly! Help me!

11:05.930 --> 11:06.530
Get up now.

11:08.030 --> 11:08.840
Thank you, My Lord.

11:08.840 --> 11:09.900
Thank you, My Lord.

11:10.320 --> 11:12.220
How many corpses are there in total?

11:12.220 --> 11:13.510
How would I know?

11:13.670 --> 11:15.510
It seems like all the bodies

11:15.510 --> 11:17.440
from the graveyard have appeared.

11:17.870 --> 11:18.750
Help me!

11:19.150 --> 11:20.200
Help me!

11:20.360 --> 11:21.270
Help me!

11:22.030 --> 11:22.960
Help me!

11:28.480 --> 11:29.720
Help me!

11:30.150 --> 11:31.130
Help me!

11:49.390 --> 11:50.000
Help!

11:55.390 --> 11:56.000
Help!

11:56.320 --> 11:56.960
Xiao Yao,

11:56.960 --> 11:57.510
save me!

11:57.670 --> 11:58.320
Help!

11:58.840 --> 11:59.440
Save me!

12:01.200 --> 12:02.010
Alright, alright.

12:02.010 --> 12:02.810
I'll go check.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.320
Xiao Yao, save me!

12:09.320 --> 12:10.080
Save me!

12:14.150 --> 12:14.870
Behind you!

12:26.150 --> 12:27.520
Thank you.

12:34.360 --> 12:35.020
Move aside!

12:44.890 --> 12:45.940
We caught it
but weren't allowed to kill it.

12:45.940 --> 12:47.200
Now it's escaped again.

12:47.200 --> 12:48.530
Bunch of useless fools.

12:49.600 --> 12:50.870
Watch your mouth.

12:50.910 --> 12:52.200
It has never harmed anyone

12:52.200 --> 12:53.530
and it just saved us now.

12:56.270 --> 12:57.100
Saved you?

12:58.140 --> 12:58.940
This demon

12:58.970 --> 12:59.910
can break free from chains

12:59.910 --> 13:01.150
and tear those corpses apart.

13:01.150 --> 13:02.270
You say it won't harm people?

13:02.270 --> 13:03.550
Use your brain.

13:03.670 --> 13:04.720
No matter how strong it is,

13:04.720 --> 13:06.080
it only used that strength to save people.

13:06.080 --> 13:07.510
If it had used that power against you,

13:07.510 --> 13:09.370
do you think you'd still be alive?

13:09.550 --> 13:10.480
I'm done arguing with you.

13:10.480 --> 13:12.200
Who's coming with me to catch the Taotie?

13:12.200 --> 13:14.600
Li, Xiao Yao has a point.

13:15.240 --> 13:16.720
After tonight's ordeal,

13:16.720 --> 13:18.410
if you go back into the mountains
to hunt the demon,

13:18.410 --> 13:19.870
you'll likely not return.

13:22.720 --> 13:23.240
Leader,

13:24.200 --> 13:26.010
my talismans failed to stop the demon.

13:26.010 --> 13:27.010
I am responsible.

13:27.240 --> 13:28.170
I'll go with him.

13:28.270 --> 13:29.530
My Lord, you cannot go.

13:30.840 --> 13:31.300
My Lord,

13:32.030 --> 13:33.240
tonight's situation

13:33.440 --> 13:35.320
is something we've never seen before.

13:35.320 --> 13:37.000
If the demon comes back

13:37.250 --> 13:39.310
we certainly won't be able to resist.

13:39.320 --> 13:40.250
Please, My Lord,

13:40.550 --> 13:41.800
stay with us

13:42.370 --> 13:43.860
to guard this village

13:43.890 --> 13:46.960
and protect the women,
children, and elderly.

13:49.680 --> 13:50.170
My Lord.

13:51.510 --> 13:52.480
I'll go check.

13:52.750 --> 13:53.280
Xiao Yao.

13:53.860 --> 13:54.660
Don't worry.

13:54.910 --> 13:56.670
That demon doesn't seem evil to me.

13:56.670 --> 13:57.840
It actually seems quite humane.

13:57.840 --> 13:59.000
If Li encounters it,

13:59.000 --> 14:00.270
someone will surely get hurt.

14:00.270 --> 14:01.670
We can't let that happen.

14:08.550 --> 14:10.380
Those zombies just now
had no demonic power.

14:10.380 --> 14:12.000
Their minds were confused too.

14:12.000 --> 14:14.930
They must have been
cursed by someone to harm people.

14:15.720 --> 14:16.670
I will set up

14:16.670 --> 14:17.750
a formation around the village.

14:17.750 --> 14:19.200
If demons attack again,

14:19.200 --> 14:20.860
we'll be warned immediately.

14:22.120 --> 14:23.710
Well, My Lord,

14:24.000 --> 14:25.840
how can we help?

14:28.790 --> 14:30.660
Tell the villagers to go home and rest.

14:30.660 --> 14:31.990
I can handle this alone.

14:33.050 --> 14:33.510
Then...

14:33.580 --> 14:34.700
Thank you, My Lord.

14:34.910 --> 14:35.970
Thank you, My Lord.

14:37.350 --> 14:38.820
Let's go.

15:07.360 --> 15:08.200
What's this?

15:08.550 --> 15:09.670
How come I suddenly can't see clearly?

15:09.670 --> 15:10.440
Why is there so much fog?

15:10.440 --> 15:11.500
What's happening?

15:20.750 --> 15:21.960
Greetings, My Lord.

15:24.910 --> 15:27.110
Weren't you at the celestial mountain?

15:27.150 --> 15:28.610
Those official ladies...

15:33.790 --> 15:34.440
My Lord,

15:35.150 --> 15:36.880
we received reports from the government

15:36.880 --> 15:38.360
that the Mount Qiansui area

15:38.360 --> 15:39.910
has been troubled
by demons for a long time.

15:39.910 --> 15:42.110
That's why we rushed here without rest.

15:42.510 --> 15:43.970
I came for the same reason.

15:46.140 --> 15:47.400
Since that's the case,

15:47.810 --> 15:49.120
I'll trouble all of you

15:49.480 --> 15:51.410
to help me protect the people here.

15:57.360 --> 15:58.220
As you command.

15:58.360 --> 16:00.220
-As you command!
-As you command!

16:05.600 --> 16:06.930
Thank you for your help,

16:07.270 --> 16:08.070
Commander Ji.

16:13.200 --> 16:14.800
Don't step on the formation!

16:16.230 --> 16:17.030
Alright.

16:29.800 --> 16:31.040
Kneel down!

16:40.440 --> 16:41.770
Come, sir.

16:42.710 --> 16:43.570
Get up quickly.

16:45.440 --> 16:46.360
Commander Ji,

16:48.000 --> 16:49.870
you're quite imperious.

16:51.250 --> 16:52.350
I wouldn't dare.

16:52.770 --> 16:54.110
Put away your blades!

17:01.090 --> 17:03.290
This village is already impoverished.

17:04.560 --> 17:06.079
None of you

17:07.089 --> 17:08.819
are to disturb the villagers.

17:10.880 --> 17:11.400
Yes.

17:14.880 --> 17:15.640
Rise up now.

17:17.720 --> 17:18.720
-Get up.
-My Lord,

17:18.740 --> 17:19.829
we work for the court

17:19.829 --> 17:21.089
and receive court salaries.

17:21.089 --> 17:23.240
Why bother associating
with these peasants?

17:23.240 --> 17:24.550
If you want to play the humble official,

17:24.550 --> 17:26.069
you can do that back in the capital.

17:26.069 --> 17:27.400
In this barren place,

17:27.510 --> 17:29.040
who are you performing for?

17:34.070 --> 17:34.980
Commander Ji,

17:35.270 --> 17:36.800
without the common people,

17:37.200 --> 17:38.530
there would be no court.

17:39.530 --> 17:41.340
Without the people's taxes,

17:41.980 --> 17:43.980
where would our salaries come from?

17:45.630 --> 17:47.560
You're absolutely right, My Lord.

17:50.030 --> 17:51.340
Feiyu Guards, attention!

17:51.340 --> 17:52.010
-Yes!
-Yes!

17:52.560 --> 17:53.950
Split into four teams

17:54.120 --> 17:56.800
and set up defensive formations
around the village.

17:56.800 --> 17:59.260
Take over patrol duties
from the villagers.

17:59.580 --> 18:01.110
If any great demon appears,

18:02.020 --> 18:03.280
protect the villagers

18:04.910 --> 18:06.280
with all your might.

18:06.590 --> 18:07.270
-Yes!
-Yes!

18:10.920 --> 18:12.000
Let's go.

18:12.110 --> 18:12.720
Go.

18:40.710 --> 18:41.270
My Lord,

18:41.890 --> 18:43.910
there's something I don't understand.

18:43.910 --> 18:44.590
Speak.

18:44.900 --> 18:45.830
Your demon-slaying blade

18:45.830 --> 18:48.450
that never left your side before,
even while sleeping...

18:48.450 --> 18:49.460
where is it now?

18:52.560 --> 18:54.920
My Lord, since your return
from the celestial mountain,

18:54.920 --> 18:56.960
did the immortals provide any guidance

18:56.960 --> 18:59.090
about the location of the Yuli Spring?

19:03.860 --> 19:05.930
You must have found the Yuli Spring water

19:05.930 --> 19:08.940
and only need to present it
to the emperor in the capital.

19:08.940 --> 19:11.140
I offer my congratulations in advance.

19:11.170 --> 19:12.750
If you receive promotions and titles,

19:12.750 --> 19:14.470
please look out for me.

19:14.610 --> 19:16.810
Thank you in advance.

19:17.750 --> 19:19.550
I haven't found the Yuli Spring.

19:19.780 --> 19:22.390
But there's an extraordinarily powerful
great demon nearby.

19:22.390 --> 19:23.670
If we can eliminate it,

19:24.750 --> 19:26.280
you can have all the credit.

19:28.170 --> 19:29.930
You probably know better than me

19:29.930 --> 19:31.650
what the emperor wants.

19:33.780 --> 19:35.100
I'm overstepping,

19:35.920 --> 19:38.250
but I just want to
remind you of something.

19:38.370 --> 19:39.830
If you return to the capital alone

19:39.830 --> 19:41.480
without the Yuli Spring water

19:41.480 --> 19:43.050
to gain the emperor's protection,

19:43.050 --> 19:45.850
those officials' daughters
that you took away...

19:47.500 --> 19:49.480
The powerful families in the capital

19:49.480 --> 19:51.790
won't let you off easily.

19:55.720 --> 19:57.440
It's not your place

19:57.850 --> 19:59.830
to lecture me.

20:01.260 --> 20:03.000
I'm only concerned

20:03.340 --> 20:04.900
for your welfare.

21:15.920 --> 21:16.640
Water.

21:17.640 --> 21:18.310
Water.

21:41.090 --> 21:41.720
Li.

21:43.290 --> 21:43.940
Li?

22:43.090 --> 22:44.330
Demon King.

22:46.980 --> 22:48.940
Mr. Ji, you're fashionably late.

22:50.000 --> 22:51.480
And you arranged to meet me

22:51.480 --> 22:53.480
in such a remote and strange place.

22:54.350 --> 22:56.030
Why so cautious?

22:56.860 --> 22:57.970
You jest, My Lord.

22:58.590 --> 23:00.330
Your power is extraordinary.

23:00.350 --> 23:01.830
I am just a mere human.

23:01.960 --> 23:03.350
I need to rely on you.

23:06.440 --> 23:08.400
Mr. Ji, since you are so cautious,

23:09.160 --> 23:11.360
if someone ruins our plans,

23:12.600 --> 23:14.230
what shall we do?

23:17.700 --> 23:19.310
My Lord, please don't blame me.

23:19.310 --> 23:20.460
Bingzhu's arrival

23:20.490 --> 23:22.090
was unexpected to me as well.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.920
He only said he heard about a great demon

23:23.920 --> 23:25.180
and came to capture it.

23:25.310 --> 23:25.790
But

23:26.320 --> 23:28.380
his demon-slaying blade is missing.

23:28.840 --> 23:31.040
Something serious must have happened.

23:31.680 --> 23:33.210
Did he find the Yuli Spring?

23:33.400 --> 23:34.240
I'm certain

23:34.630 --> 23:35.980
he didn't find it.

23:39.360 --> 23:41.390
With his sudden arrival,

23:42.760 --> 23:43.970
should we continue

23:44.110 --> 23:45.110
our plan?

23:45.140 --> 23:45.970
Of course not.

23:47.370 --> 23:48.610
His appearance

23:48.920 --> 23:50.480
is unexpected, but...

23:52.680 --> 23:54.820
it is heaven-sent.

23:56.200 --> 23:57.410
What do you mean?

24:05.240 --> 24:07.140
This is the Yuli Spring

24:07.350 --> 24:10.240
that Master Bingzhu obtained
at the cost of his life.

24:10.240 --> 24:11.920
I will do my utmost

24:12.790 --> 24:14.390
to present it to His Majesty.

24:14.570 --> 24:16.900
Didn't you say he didn't find Yuli Spring?

24:19.920 --> 24:21.040
Lord Heiwu,

24:21.700 --> 24:24.420
everyone has heard of
the Yuli Spring water,

24:24.440 --> 24:25.900
but no one has ever seen it.

24:25.910 --> 24:26.940
In other words,

24:27.400 --> 24:29.330
as long as drinking it doesn't kill you,

24:29.330 --> 24:31.350
it can all be called the Yuli Spring.

24:33.680 --> 24:35.740
This is what Master Bingzhu received

24:36.160 --> 24:38.000
in exchanged for his life.

24:43.750 --> 24:45.860
Then, Mr. Ji, what do you want?

24:47.030 --> 24:47.960
What I want

24:48.200 --> 24:51.190
is only to
wholeheartedly serve you, Demon King.

24:52.240 --> 24:54.850
You need not worry about
the Feiyu Guard slaughtering demons again.

24:54.850 --> 24:56.960
You only need to provide us with some

24:57.100 --> 25:00.030
minor demons that haven't
gone through the test yet.

25:07.490 --> 25:09.820
Demon Slayer, you're quite calculating.

25:10.090 --> 25:11.420
I fear one day

25:12.410 --> 25:14.780
you'll scheme against me too.

25:17.100 --> 25:18.200
I wouldn't dare.

25:18.620 --> 25:20.280
We are all your soldiers.

25:20.400 --> 25:21.510
The Feiyu Guard will

25:21.510 --> 25:23.710
serve the Demon King with all our might.

25:25.480 --> 25:26.010
Who is it?

25:26.830 --> 25:27.480
Immortal!

25:28.310 --> 25:29.510
An immortal has come!

25:32.010 --> 25:34.670
Why did you come down from Mount Qiansui?

25:36.280 --> 25:37.970
No need for such formality.

25:38.480 --> 25:39.110
Immortal!

25:39.320 --> 25:41.450
I heard about the village's suffering

25:41.550 --> 25:43.610
and that many people have fallen ill.

25:43.890 --> 25:46.490
I've brought the Yuli Spring
down the mountain

25:47.290 --> 25:49.090
to help relieve your suffering.

25:49.440 --> 25:50.640
Thank you, Immortal.

25:50.720 --> 25:52.060
You are so merciful!

25:52.080 --> 25:53.280
Quickly show the way.

25:54.590 --> 25:55.190
Immortal,

25:55.240 --> 25:55.950
this way please.

25:55.950 --> 25:56.770
To the village, please.

25:56.770 --> 25:57.770
This way, please.

26:27.330 --> 26:28.650
You really are Ya.

26:43.200 --> 26:43.750
No!

26:45.110 --> 26:45.680
Li,

26:46.270 --> 26:47.920
she is your wife, Ya.

26:48.750 --> 26:49.710
If you keep talking nonsense,

26:49.710 --> 26:50.890
I'll cut you down too.

26:50.890 --> 26:52.420
What I'm saying is all true.

26:52.480 --> 26:54.010
She wasn't eaten by demons.

26:54.400 --> 26:55.480
She probably became like this

26:55.480 --> 26:56.940
because she was poisoned.

26:58.140 --> 26:58.850
Look,

26:59.070 --> 26:59.830
what is this?

27:07.790 --> 27:08.520
Impossible.

27:09.290 --> 27:10.170
Tell me.

27:10.280 --> 27:11.390
Did you kill Ya

27:11.410 --> 27:12.240
and steal the jade pendant?

27:12.240 --> 27:13.780
Tell me, did you kill her?

27:14.030 --> 27:14.550
Speak!

27:14.550 --> 27:15.260
Li!

27:15.400 --> 27:15.800
You...

27:46.030 --> 27:48.050
You can't keep running away
from this anymore.

27:48.050 --> 27:49.250
She is Ya.

27:50.330 --> 27:51.360
Impossible!

27:51.910 --> 27:52.640
Impossible!

27:53.870 --> 27:55.600
Ya was the most beautiful

27:55.790 --> 27:57.850
and kind-hearted woman in the world.

27:59.860 --> 28:02.060
She's still kind. That hasn't changed.

28:02.120 --> 28:03.720
Look at the herbs on your arm.

28:08.010 --> 28:09.030
Think about it.

28:09.100 --> 28:10.790
Why does she always go to the village,

28:10.790 --> 28:12.120
yet never hurts anyone?

28:12.510 --> 28:13.960
Why are you the one

28:13.960 --> 28:16.050
who sees her first
whenever she visits the village?

28:16.050 --> 28:17.940
Why is it that every time
you chase and hurt her,

28:17.940 --> 28:19.860
she never harms you in return,

28:21.960 --> 28:23.270
and only runs away?

28:49.590 --> 28:50.590
It's all my fault.

28:54.110 --> 28:55.030
My Lord,

28:55.200 --> 28:56.640
we've been patrolling
all village entrances

28:56.640 --> 28:58.440
but found no trace of any demons.

29:01.030 --> 29:01.960
There's a demon!

29:02.000 --> 29:03.000
A demon is coming!

29:03.110 --> 29:04.030
Demon!

29:05.110 --> 29:05.830
-Run!
-Run!

29:06.350 --> 29:06.880
Zixiu.

29:07.720 --> 29:08.520
What's wrong?

29:08.790 --> 29:10.040
I saw a demon.

29:10.300 --> 29:11.680
What did this demon look like?

29:11.680 --> 29:12.880
He wore a big black robe,

29:12.880 --> 29:13.880
had a pale face,

29:13.880 --> 29:15.070
and was not very tall.

29:15.070 --> 29:16.720
The person talking to him

29:16.720 --> 29:17.720
just now...

29:21.810 --> 29:22.400
Zixiu.

29:23.720 --> 29:24.980
Don't point like that.

29:38.110 --> 29:40.270
The Taotie has returned!

29:40.300 --> 29:41.850
The Taotie is back!

29:54.240 --> 29:55.170
Feiyu Guards,

29:55.740 --> 29:56.940
Eight Sun Formation!

30:18.920 --> 30:19.750
Stop!

30:22.440 --> 30:23.770
She's not a demon.

30:24.110 --> 30:25.150
She's Ya.

30:38.480 --> 30:39.240
Ya?

31:17.190 --> 31:17.740
I...

31:25.000 --> 31:25.810
It's all my fault.

31:25.810 --> 31:26.650
All my fault.

31:27.610 --> 31:29.340
I should have realized sooner.

31:30.620 --> 31:31.460
Every day,

31:31.930 --> 31:33.860
you snuck into the village at night

31:34.390 --> 31:35.630
just to see me.

31:36.690 --> 31:37.750
When I stabbed you,

31:39.250 --> 31:40.910
there were tears in your eyes.

31:41.980 --> 31:43.880
Every time I returned
from hunting in the mountains,

31:43.880 --> 31:45.230
empty-handed,

31:45.870 --> 31:46.680
there would always be prey

31:46.680 --> 31:48.680
appearing on my path home.

31:49.100 --> 31:50.080
I'm so stupid.

31:50.960 --> 31:53.420
I didn't hear
what you were trying to tell me.

31:54.160 --> 31:54.800
Ya,

31:55.440 --> 31:56.310
do you hate me?

31:58.680 --> 32:00.670
You did so much and waited so long,

32:00.920 --> 32:02.140
yet I didn't recognize you.

32:02.140 --> 32:04.400
I'm so stupid. I deserve to die.

32:06.120 --> 32:08.050
I've caused you so much suffering.

32:08.620 --> 32:09.380
I miss you.

32:19.840 --> 32:20.400
Xiao Yao,

32:20.840 --> 32:21.910
why are you crying?

32:23.790 --> 32:27.500
Ya can never return to her original form.

32:29.920 --> 32:31.090
What are you thinking of doing?

32:31.090 --> 32:32.060
I'm telling you,

32:32.150 --> 32:33.610
don't even think about it.

32:34.110 --> 32:35.960
The real Taotie hasn't been found yet.

32:35.960 --> 32:38.650
I still need my strength
to protect your life.

32:40.790 --> 32:43.110
You have a way
to turn her back to her original form?

32:43.110 --> 32:44.100
I'm telling you,

32:44.450 --> 32:46.310
I won't agree to it no matter what.

32:47.720 --> 32:49.040
Little Leaf,

32:49.070 --> 32:50.750
please.

32:51.370 --> 32:52.930
I know I'm dumb.

32:52.960 --> 32:55.020
I didn't study techniques properly.

32:55.030 --> 32:56.400
My power is too weak.

32:57.030 --> 32:58.350
Now, I want to save someone

32:58.350 --> 33:00.510
but have no way to do it.

33:03.350 --> 33:04.440
Don't cry anymore.

33:06.440 --> 33:07.400
Alright, alright.

33:07.400 --> 33:09.560
I'll do it. I'll do it, alright?

33:10.750 --> 33:11.810
But I must tell you,

33:11.920 --> 33:12.680
my technique

33:12.680 --> 33:14.690
can only turn her back for one hour.

33:14.830 --> 33:16.000
After using the technique,

33:16.000 --> 33:17.310
I'll turn into a straw bracele.t

33:17.310 --> 33:18.240
If you face danger again,

33:18.240 --> 33:21.300
-you can only rely on yourself.
-Okay. Change quickly.

34:36.730 --> 34:37.560
Thank you.

34:57.360 --> 34:58.880
Immortal, please bless us.

34:58.880 --> 35:00.630
Immortal, please bless us.

35:00.630 --> 35:02.590
Bring us fortune and ward off disaster!

35:02.590 --> 35:04.630
Immortal, please bless us.

35:04.630 --> 35:07.000
Bring us fortune and ward off disaster!

35:09.780 --> 35:11.490
Do not panic, everyone.

35:11.960 --> 35:13.590
I have come here

35:13.590 --> 35:17.280
to relieve your suffering.

35:19.070 --> 35:21.470
Drink the Yuli Spring water
from my bottle.

35:21.670 --> 35:23.030
You will surely

35:23.490 --> 35:25.350
be cured of all illnesses

35:25.550 --> 35:26.960
and gain immortality.

35:26.960 --> 35:29.550
-Thank you, Immortal.
-Thank you, Immortal.

35:30.210 --> 35:31.240
Ya!

35:33.790 --> 35:34.660
Zixiu?

35:35.110 --> 35:36.310
You're finally back!

35:36.510 --> 35:37.670
Where are the other villagers?

35:37.670 --> 35:38.670
A demon entered the village

35:38.670 --> 35:40.130
and gathered everyone.

35:41.810 --> 35:42.630
Follow me.

35:47.120 --> 35:49.260
Don't drink it!

35:49.870 --> 35:50.990
Don't drink!

35:51.310 --> 35:52.140
Don't!

35:54.920 --> 35:55.380
This...

35:56.400 --> 35:57.590
He's not an Immortal.

35:57.590 --> 35:58.710
He's a demon!

35:59.200 --> 36:00.230
Demon?

36:01.200 --> 36:03.910
I became a demon after drinking his water!

36:03.930 --> 36:05.410
You'll turn into a demon if you drink it.

36:05.410 --> 36:06.600
What's going on?

36:18.840 --> 36:19.880
Demon,

36:19.920 --> 36:21.250
die!

36:24.960 --> 36:26.780
Without the demon-slaying blade,

36:26.780 --> 36:28.170
you think you can kill me?

36:28.170 --> 36:30.890
The Feiyu Guard's reputation
extends far and wide,

36:30.890 --> 36:32.980
and it's not just because of this blade.

36:32.980 --> 36:34.110
Form the formation!

36:35.880 --> 36:36.940
What's happening?

36:38.030 --> 36:39.520
My Lord, I'm sorry,

36:39.670 --> 36:41.530
but following you leads nowhere.

36:45.590 --> 36:47.440
Everyone here today

36:48.390 --> 36:49.580
must die.

36:51.650 --> 36:53.420
With me here,

36:53.480 --> 36:56.460
you lowly Heiwu, kneel down!

36:57.400 --> 37:00.050
You use the demon race's name

37:00.070 --> 37:01.800
to slaughter innocent people.

37:02.050 --> 37:03.670
Truly despicable!

37:04.290 --> 37:04.970
You...

37:07.450 --> 37:08.610
We meet again.

37:18.150 --> 37:19.280
Mount Qiansui,

37:20.760 --> 37:22.400
is remote and isolated,

37:22.430 --> 37:24.330
surrounded by mountains and rivers.

37:24.330 --> 37:25.720
Troublemakers run rampant,

37:25.720 --> 37:27.580
disrespecting imperial orders,

37:27.850 --> 37:30.060
always seeking violence.

37:30.220 --> 37:31.130
Today,

37:31.810 --> 37:34.390
you even conspire with a demoness
and raise mythical beasts,

37:34.390 --> 37:35.830
causing havoc everywhere.

37:35.830 --> 37:36.760
The Feiyu Guard,

37:36.960 --> 37:39.420
representing Tiansheng Kingdom's
righteous army,

37:39.420 --> 37:40.420
has come here

37:41.090 --> 37:42.740
to execute traitors

37:44.240 --> 37:46.030
and eliminate future threats.

37:46.800 --> 37:47.800
I'll deal with

37:48.630 --> 37:49.920
this demoness myself.

38:06.280 --> 38:07.240
Little Leaf.

38:08.960 --> 38:09.920
Little Leaf.

38:16.480 --> 38:17.230
Hong Ye.

38:19.480 --> 38:20.700
Hong Ye!

38:21.320 --> 38:22.580
If you don't come soon,

38:22.850 --> 38:24.580
I'll have to strangle her.

38:29.320 --> 38:30.920
This neck feels so familiar.

38:32.590 --> 38:35.210
Why isn't your Hong Ye
coming to save you today?

38:39.340 --> 38:40.340
Let's fight them!

38:44.490 --> 38:45.300
Li!

38:57.070 --> 38:57.710
Villains!

38:57.890 --> 38:59.270
You're all villains!

39:15.760 --> 39:16.510
Xiao Yao!

39:43.650 --> 39:44.520
Zixiu!

39:45.150 --> 39:45.920
Zixiu!

39:47.440 --> 39:48.230
Zixiu!

39:48.550 --> 39:49.360
Zixiu!

39:52.150 --> 39:52.680
Xiao Yao.

40:01.950 --> 40:02.640
Zixiu.

40:08.550 --> 40:09.150
Zixiu.

40:12.280 --> 40:13.150
Zixiu.
